  "citation": "Willis, J. K., S. Fournier, K. Marlis, E. Killett and J. Sanchez (2026). NASA-SSH: JPL Sea Surface Height Anomalies, Version 1.1. Ver. 1.1. PO.DAAC, CA, USA. https://doi.org/10.5067/NSREF-SG0V11",
